!PADS-POWERPCB-V9.5-MILS! DESIGN DATABASE ASCII FILE 1.0

*PCB*        GENERAL PARAMETERS OF THE PCB

UNITS 0
ORIGIN 0.0 0.0
MAXIMUMLAYER 2

*LAYER*      LAYER DEFINITIONS

1 TOP
2 BOTTOM

*PARTDECAL*  PART DECAL ITEMS

SHAPE_DECAL I 0 0 0 4 4 0 0
T-45 30 -45 30 1
T45 30 45 30 2
T-45 -30 -45 -30 3
T45 -30 45 -30 4
PAD 1 3
-2 24 R 0 N
-1 0 R
0 0 R
PAD 2 3
-2 24 S 0 0 N
-1 0 R
0 0 R
PAD 3 3
-2 18 RF 30 42 6 0 0 N
-1 0 R
0 0 R
PAD 4 3
-2 18 OF 90 46 -6 0 N
-1 0 R
0 0 R

*PARTTYPE*   PART TYPE ITEMS

SHAPE_TYPE SHAPE_DECAL I UND 0 0 0 0 Y

*PART*       PART ITEMS

U1 SHAPE_TYPE 140 150 15 U N 0 -1 0 -1 0
U2 SHAPE_TYPE 360 150 345 U M 0 -1 0 -1 0

*NET*        NET LIST ITEMS

*SIGNAL* GND
U1.1 U2.1
*SIGNAL* DATA
U1.2 U2.2

*LINES*      LINES ITEMS

BOARD_OUTLINE BOARD 0 0 1 0
CLOSED 5 4 0 0
0 0
500 0
500 300
0 300
0 0

*END*
